DESCRIPTION:Join the Occidental Community Choir as we turn music into moti
 on and passion into purpose.\nGeneral Admission:\n$25\nKids 12 & under:\nF
 ree\nBe sure to get your tickets in advance so you don’t miss out!\nOnli
 ne ticket sales close 4 hours before show time.\nIf you’re too late to b
 uy tickets online for the show you want\, or if all online tickets for tha
 t show have been sold\, we do set aside\nat least 20 tickets for purchase 
 at the door.\nGet tickets on the Occidental Community Choir’s Website.\n
 Music helps us to make sense of the world\, gives voice to that which matt
 ers most\, and serves as a reminder that\nnone of us have to stand alone.\
 nThis season we'll explore songs of joy\, hope\, resilience\, justice\, an
 d protest. Some of our programming will\nchallenge us to confront difficul
 t truths\nand some of it will remind us that even in times of division\,\n
 compassion\, courage\, and community can light the way forward.\nAs a prog
 ram\, it will ask:\nHow do we rise together and what kind of world will we
  leave behind?
